        },
        {
          "text": " Aso kinyeis ileic airum jo kanuka aitejenun naka Ejakaitiwok, karaida kanukaŋ, eenatake, konye kiticaneneno nepepe kAkiro Nukajokak, kwape ejaar apedor naka Edeke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
